"/en/kobe-shri-chaitanya-more-koribena-daya/","title":"Dainya Prārthanā Gīti"},"next":{"path":"/en/shri-guru-charana-padma-kevala-bhakati/","title":"Śrī-Guru-Vaiṣṇava Māhātmya Gīti"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":78,"author":"Śrīla Chandraśekhara Kavi","first_line":"namo namaḥ tulasī mahārāṇī"},"title":["Śrī Tulasī-parikramā Gīti"],"author":["Braj Bhāṣā composition by Śrīla Chandraśekhara Kavi"],"verses":[{"text":["namo namaḥ tulasī mahārāṇī","vṛnde mahārāṇī namo namaḥ"],"translation":["O Tulasī Mahārāṇī, O Vṛnda Devī, I offer my obeisances unto you again and again."],"isLong":false},{"number":"1","text":["namo re namo re mā̐iyā namo nārāyaṇī"],"translation":["O Nārāyaṇi I offer you my obeisances again and again."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["yā̐ko daraśe paraśe agha-nāśa hoi","mahimā veda-purāṇe vākhāni"],"translation":["By seeing or touching you, all sins are destroyed. Your glories are sung in the Vedas and Purāṇas."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["yā̐ko patra mañjarī komala","śrī-pati-charaṇa-kamale lepaṭāni","dhanya tulasī pūraṇa tapa kiye","śrī-śālagrāma-mahāpāṭarāṇī"],"translation":["Your leaves and soft mañjarīs are entwined at the lotus feet of Lord Nārāyaṇa. O Tulasī, by your performance of austerity you have become the worshipful consort of Śrī Śālagrām-śilā."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["dhūpa, dīpa, naivedya, ārati","phulanā kiye varakhā varakhāni","chhāppānna bhoga, chhatriśa vyañjana","vinā tulasī prabhu eka nāhi māni"],"translation":["You shower your mercy upon anyone who offers you incense, lamp, foodstuffs, worship and flowers. The Lord does not accept even one of fifty-six food offerings or thirty-six curries offered without Tulasī leaves."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["śiva śuka nārada āura brahmādika","ḍhu̐ḍata phirata mahāmuni jñānī","chandraśekhara mā̐iyā, terā yaśa gāoye","bhakati dāna dījiye mahārāṇī"],"translation":["Lord Śiva, Śukadeva Goswāmī, Nārada Muni, all the demigods headed by Lord Brahmā, the mystics, and great munis are all circumambulating you, O Tulasī Mahārāṇī. Thus Chandraśekhara sings of your glories. Please bestow upon him the gift of devotion."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/kostya-netrebenko/05-namo-namah-tulasi-maharani-13","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/namo-namah-tulasi-maharani","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Śrī-Tulasī-parikramā-gīti-02-22-2"},"head":{"canonical":"/en/namo-namah-tulasi-maharani/","description":"Śrī Tulasī-parikramā Gīti — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Chandraśekhara Kavi with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Śrī Tulasī-parikramā Gīti. Braj Bhāṣā composition by Śrīla Chandraśekhara Kavi | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en","slug":"namo-namah-tulasi-maharani"}}